# Generated files whose generator cannot run in CI (R1188-U8).
#
# scripts/check-generated-files.mjs fails on a file whose header says
# "Generated by `<command>`" unless a CI gate or workflow runs that generator,
# so a hand edit of a generated file cannot be merged. A generator that needs
# what CI does not have is listed here, with the reason; the row must go once
# CI checks the file.
generated-files
  unchecked "docs/case-studies/pull-request-1188/user-messages.md"
    reason "Collected from the operator's Claude Code session history under ~/.claude, which CI does not have; --check runs where the sessions are."
  unchecked "data/meta/issue-state.lino"
    reason "An operator-run snapshot of open issues through the authenticated GitHub CLI; it changes only by review of a refreshed snapshot."
